(7115228, 1086252, 136989, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.  I often wish I could go back in time, just for a bit, to see what things were like back then.  Riding fences on horseback for days...etc.  wonderful warm colors and I like the magical quality the haze adds.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.  I often wish I could go back in time, just for a bit, to see what things were like back then.  Riding fences on horseback for days...etc.  wonderful warm colors and I like the magical quality the haze adds.', '2013-10-13 19:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
