(7115395, 1086169, 136989, '<td valign="top">Simply gorgeous!!  Wonderful ethereal feel with the haze, terrific golden light, that absolutely adorable baby horse and the foreground details.  Wouldn''t surprise me to see a ribbon head your way on this one.  My favorite in this challenge.  <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1082013" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Simply gorgeous!!  Wonderful ethereal feel with the haze, terrific golden light, that absolutely adorable baby horse and the foreground details.  Wouldn''t surprise me to see a ribbon head your way on this one.  My favorite in this challenge.  ', '2013-10-14 00:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
