(7115827, 1086386, 39429, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration and clarity. The perspective high above the earth is nice. I don''t feel it really shows a clear beginning or end.  There are also flaws above the wing tip that draw my eye in a negative way.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration and clarity. The perspective high above the earth is nice. I don''t feel it really shows a clear beginning or end.  There are also flaws above the wing tip that draw my eye in a negative way.', '2013-10-15 01:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7115828, 1086095, 39429, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 5.  I like the graphic nature of the shot.  There are some very nice textures and patterns. The perspective looking down is nice. I don''t feel it really shows a clear beginning or end.  I''m losing the people in the high contrast.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 5.  I like the graphic nature of the shot.  There are some very nice textures and patterns. The perspective looking down is nice. I don''t feel it really shows a clear beginning or end.  I''m losing the people in the high contrast.', '2013-10-15 01:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7115829, 1086323, 39429, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 5.  I like the composition and textures. Using the full tonal range to solid blacks could add to the drama and feel of death.  Unfortunately the subject matter is not one that works for me without something else such as stronger processing to  make me want to look longer.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 5.  I like the composition and textures. Using the full tonal range to solid blacks could add to the drama and feel of death.  Unfortunately the subject matter is not one that works for me without something else such as stronger processing to  make me want to look longer.', '2013-10-15 01:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7115830, 1086026, 39429, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration and clarity. The perspective looking into the store is nice. I don''t feel it really shows a clear beginning or end.  Unfortunately, I don''t find the image especially interesting.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration and clarity. The perspective looking into the store is nice. I don''t feel it really shows a clear beginning or end.  Unfortunately, I don''t find the image especially interesting.', '2013-10-15 01:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7115831, 1085742, 39429, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration, dof and clarity. Unfortunately, the remains of the egg are "yucky" and keep me from wanting to stay with the image longer.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration, dof and clarity. Unfortunately, the remains of the egg are "yucky" and keep me from wanting to stay with the image longer.', '2013-10-15 01:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7115832, 1086151, 39429, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration and clarity. Using dof to emphasize "beginning" is good. I don''t feel that there is enough of your own creativity in the shot to score higher.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration and clarity. Using dof to emphasize "beginning" is good. I don''t feel that there is enough of your own creativity in the shot to score higher.', '2013-10-15 02:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7115833, 1086054, 39429, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration and clarity. The perspective along the water line is nice. I don''t feel it really shows a clear beginning or end.  The image has so much going on there is not a clear focal emphasis, but all looks important, even though is isn''t.  It has too much visual clutter for my taste.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration and clarity. The perspective along the water line is nice. I don''t feel it really shows a clear beginning or end.  The image has so much going on there is not a clear focal emphasis, but all looks important, even though is isn''t.  It has too much visual clutter for my taste.', '2013-10-15 02:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7115834, 1086014, 39429, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration and silhouette.  The top half of the image is lovely. In order to do well on DPC, a sunrise/sunset image needs something special. I don''t feel this has it and in fact the cars and stadium lights take away from the natural aspect of the image.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration and silhouette.  The top half of the image is lovely. In order to do well on DPC, a sunrise/sunset image needs something special. I don''t feel this has it and in fact the cars and stadium lights take away from the natural aspect of the image.', '2013-10-15 02:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7115835, 1086188, 39429, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 5.  I like the backdrop and the unique view.  I''m losing detail in the girl and had to look for quite a while to figure it out. I don''t feel it really shows a clear beginning or end without the title.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 5.  I like the backdrop and the unique view.  I''m losing detail in the girl and had to look for quite a while to figure it out. I don''t feel it really shows a clear beginning or end without the title.', '2013-10-15 02:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7115836, 1085555, 39429, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration and textures. The perspective from near the ground is nice. There is not enough detail or sharpness in the pumpkin or seeds to direct my eyes to the important aspect of the image.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration and textures. The perspective from near the ground is nice. There is not enough detail or sharpness in the pumpkin or seeds to direct my eyes to the important aspect of the image.', '2013-10-15 02:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7115837, 1086245, 39429, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 5.  I like the color in the sky and texture of the city.. The perspective above the city is nice. While it implies an end to the day, I don''t feel it really shows a clear beginning or end without the title.  The processing is rather flat, keeping the shot from having more interest.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 5.  I like the color in the sky and texture of the city.. The perspective above the city is nice. While it implies an end to the day, I don''t feel it really shows a clear beginning or end without the title.  The processing is rather flat, keeping the shot from having more interest.', '2013-10-15 02:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7115838, 1086385, 39429, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration and sharpnes. The idea is interesting with a nice play on words with the title. Unfortunately, the contrast is so high there is little detail and so looses interest for me.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration and sharpnes. The idea is interesting with a nice play on words with the title. Unfortunately, the contrast is so high there is little detail and so looses interest for me.', '2013-10-15 02:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7115839, 1086403, 39429, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 5.  I like the humor. The "slice of life" feel is nice. I don''t feel it really shows a clear beginning or end.  It feels more like a snapshot than an illustration of the challenge.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 5.  I like the humor. The "slice of life" feel is nice. I don''t feel it really shows a clear beginning or end.  It feels more like a snapshot than an illustration of the challenge.', '2013-10-15 02:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7115840, 1086319, 39429, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 5.  I like the concept and crop. The graphic aspect of the shot is nice. The image could have been stronger for me if it were sharper with more detail.  There is a lot of interest in the details we can''t see.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 5.  I like the concept and crop. The graphic aspect of the shot is nice. The image could have been stronger for me if it were sharper with more detail.  There is a lot of interest in the details we can''t see.', '2013-10-15 02:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7115841, 1085528, 39429, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration and clarity. I don''t feel it really shows a clear beginning or end.  I may be missing the point, but here the hanging shoe is a gang affiliation symbol.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 5.  I like the coloration and clarity. I don''t feel it really shows a clear beginning or end.  I may be missing the point, but here the hanging shoe is a gang affiliation symbol.', '2013-10-15 02:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7115842, 1086370, 39429, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a 5.  I like the ominous feel of the shot. It feels like a quickly captured shot of a potential kidnapping. The lack of clarity in any of the shot bothered me.</td>', 'I gave this shot a 5.  I like the ominous feel of the shot. It feels like a quickly captured shot of a potential kidnapping. The lack of clarity in any of the shot bothered me.', '2013-10-15 02:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
