(7117738, 1086370, 124815, '<td valign="top">My mark (oh yes, it''s important!) was a 9 only because the silly ipad did not register the bump to 10.<br/>It''s part of my favorite shots.<br/>Again, my mind went to Tarkovsky, and my reading was way more gentle than I read in other comments. It has to do with paving the road, with family ties, with the clearing in the forest and a slew of other symbolic elements. Life itself</td>', 'My mark (oh yes, it''s important!) was a 9 only because the silly ipad did not register the bump to 10.It''s part of my favorite shots.Again, my mind went to Tarkovsky, and my reading was way more gentle than I read in other comments. It has to do with paving the road, with family ties, with the clearing in the forest and a slew of other symbolic elements. Life itself', '2013-10-18 01:27:16.000000', NULL, 0),
